{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":140658,"Title":"liked a post you made in Revolution Day Mexico - Get...","Message":"Hello!\n\nEadrianne1990 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@SunshineDreamKay  Congrats and welcome!\n \nI'm sorry you need to move your wedding date. Planning a wedding is stressful enough without dealing with that. Having said that, I've been through it myself but we went the opposite way - from November to October and it was Jama...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79851-revolution-day-mexico-get-married-the-next-day\/?view=findpost&p=1909412\n","Sender":{"Id":286231,"Name":"Eadrianne1990","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286231.jpg?_r=1455591065","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1456293394,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":140596,"Title":"liked a post you made in Afloral.com","Message":"Hello!\n\nEadrianne1990 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@Mrsntobe  Thanks so much for sharing something positive. You're right - we do spend so much time complaining about the lack of service on things that we do forget to praise those that provide good service! That's for the gentle reminder!\n \nI'm glad they came through for...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79371-afloralcom\/?view=findpost&p=1900177\n","Sender":{"Id":286231,"Name":"Eadrianne1990","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286231.jpg?_r=1455591065","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1456263531,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":140576,"Title":"liked a post you made in Excited And Looking For Help","Message":"Hello!\n\nEadrianne1990 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  congrats and welcome! You've come to the right place if you're looking for info and planning tips, and the ladies here are always happy to help! I see your wedding is in December so not that far away!! You've chosen a private villa - is that where your wedding is going to be or have you chosen...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79943-excited-and-looking-for-help\/?view=findpost&p=1911143\n","Sender":{"Id":286231,"Name":"Eadrianne1990","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286231.jpg?_r=1455591065","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1456249762,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":140552,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2015 Grand Sunset Princess...","Message":"Hello!\n\nnankleiner just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@lululuvs2travel  Congrats and welcome to BDW!\n \nGrand Sunset Princess \/ Grand Sunset Riviera are popular locations with brides to be here. I would highly recommend that you take some time to read through the thread here to see what past brides have said about their exper...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76890-2015-grand-sunset-princess-bride\/?view=findpost&p=1905700\n","Sender":{"Id":286305,"Name":"nankleiner","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286305.jpg?_r=1456198282","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1456229968,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":140497,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that dreamweddings mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79944-its-official-wedding-planning-consultations-are-now-available-for-you\/?view=findpost&p=1911196\n\n----------------------------------\nI totally agree, @\"acw271011\" and @\"Moments That Matter\" so many Brides are taking advantage of this, hopefully they can come and comment here to let everyone know,  how they received the help and support to get started in in planning!\n \nI am happy to help so brides dont have to feel overwhelmed, its time to change how destination wedding are projected. Be the informed bride, and enjoy the planning stage.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1456183814,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":140490,"Title":"liked a post you made in Its Official Wedding Planni...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndreamweddings just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThis will be well woth it ladies! If you just got engaged and feel like you don't know where to start, do a quick half hour or one hour call with Joyce. She will get you pointed in the right direction so that you can move forward with your planning and be relaxed about it!! After all - this is su...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79944-its-official-wedding-planning-consultations-are-now-available-for-you\/?view=findpost&p=1911141\n","Sender":{"Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1456183431,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":140388,"Title":"liked a post you made in Yycbride2016 Grand Sirenis...","Message":"Hello!\n\nyycbride2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOh god I'm so far behind.... I'm sooooo sorry! Congrats on being a Mrs!!! I'm so glad it went well!! Everything looks absolutely goegeous! You've done so much work! It will all be fantastic and you will be a stunning bride!!! I love the nails!! Great glitter!!! lol we ladies do love our bling!!...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1911112\n","Sender":{"Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1456099520,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":140300,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1911140\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" I actually got my full length video sent to me three weeks ago. It was just the highlight that we were waiting on some final edits for.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1456063155,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":140287,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1911138\n\n----------------------------------\nAwww thanks so much ladies!!  @\"acw271011\"\n\n@\"ashhtayy\" I've watched it about 30 times now hahahah\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1456062127,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":140281,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nBeautiful!! And of course it made me cry!! You guys look so happy and you both really looked like you were having fun! What a fantastic keepsake of your wedding!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1911137\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1456062086,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":140199,"Title":"liked a post you made in Yycbride2016 Grand Sirenis...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOh god I'm so far behind.... I'm sooooo sorry! Congrats on being a Mrs!!! I'm so glad it went well!! Everything looks absolutely goegeous! You've done so much work! It will all be fantastic and you will be a stunning bride!!! I love the nails!! Great glitter!!! lol we ladies do love our bling!!...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1911112\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455993378,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":139511,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that deecol mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1910961\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" No cost for the tea Ann - my MIL wouldn't let me pay.  I haven't stopped drinking tea since, it tastes like London <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>   I'll bring yours to our next meet-up.  Speaking of...\n \nShould we get another date in our diaries?  I personally have tons going on but would love to see you ladies at least once before the big day!  Any thoughts on a date in March?  The I can't do March 4th and 25th.  How does the 18th work for everyone?\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455636308,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":139507,"Title":"liked a post you made in Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet U...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndeecol just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@deecol  Wow Dee - that's awesome!! Let me know what the cost will be. I have UK pounds at home!! Thank you!!\n \n@perianjay  I know!! lol  She really looks like she wants to be in the pic!! I thought about chopping the photo to cut them out, and might still. I th...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1910428\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455636100,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":139377,"Title":"liked a post you made in Azul Sensatori - Nov 2015 W...","Message":"Hello!\n\nJanjin just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  What a wonderful review! I'm so glad everything went as planned! Your photos are stunning!! it sounds like everyone had a great time! Congrats on being a Mrs!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79934-azul-sensatori-nov-2015-wedding-review\/?view=findpost&p=1910797\n","Sender":{"Id":280967,"Name":"Janjin","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455619814,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":138942,"Title":"liked a post you made in Outside Vendor Fees","Message":"Hello!\n\nvancouverpetunia just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@cksk2016  I was in exactly this same position last October except in Mexico. We renewed our vows and had a super miniature size group, which ended up only being 4 of us. We had our ceremony off site then had a beautiful dinner in a really nice restaurant in Playa del Carmen. I had the sa...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79937-outside-vendor-fees\/?view=findpost&p=1910793\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455236597,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":138905,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that AmberDee mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79935-dreams-riviera-cancun-2016-bride-questionshelp\/?view=findpost&p=1910770\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\"\n \nThank you for your post!\n \nI am hoping to get a reservation in the restaurant so it isn't \"68 for dinner!\" I am still waiting to hear back. unfortunately, I don't think I have the budget for a private reception when you take into account all of the extras. I'm still contemplating!\n \nThe cocktail hour will be an hour, not 30 minutes-- I would do the speeches and first dance there if we don't have a private reception, otherwise there really isn't a good place for that. The cocktail hour  comes with tables and a table of appetizers, and waiters walking around with food, and a bar and a  sound system- so that will be great!\n \nI appreciate the comment about photos- I didn't realize it would take so long! definitely a lot to think about!\n \nTHANK YOU!!\n \nAD\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":286195,"Name":"AmberDee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455200875,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":138904,"Title":"liked a post you made in Dreams Riviera Cancun 2016...","Message":"Hello!\n\nAmberDee just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@AmberDee  Congrats! Dreams resorts seem to have good reviews!\n \nI'm curious about one thing - why would you not put together a proper dinner for all your guests? That may be rather awkward just showing up and asking for seating for 68 people, and my concern would be depe...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79935-dreams-riviera-cancun-2016-bride-questionshelp\/?view=findpost&p=1910762\n","Sender":{"Id":286195,"Name":"AmberDee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455200694,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":138766,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"acw271011,\n\n2ndTimeMrs has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Feeling discouraged....need advice\".\n\n2ndTimeMrs said:\n======================================================================\nHi Ann! I\u2019m back from 10 glorious days in Jamaica! Sorry I didn\u2019t get a chance to get back to you before I left, as you can imagine I was busy with all the last minute planning. I can\u2019t imagine how the girls with big destination weddings do it. I had to bring 2 extra bags to haul all my wedding decorations and stuff and it was just us and my grandparents.\nYou were right, once I got there I was so caught up in the wedding day that the fact we didn\u2019t have anyone with us really didn\u2019t matter. I was sad a couple of times (spending the morning alone, getting my hair\/makeup done with nobody I trusted to tell me if it looked ok and getting dressed) but those moments were short lived and overtaken with the sheer happiness of marrying Peter. Plus I kept hearing your words of encouragement in my head so even though you didn\u2019t physically come to Jamaica you were there <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n Misha was absolutely fantastic! I already felt very comfortable with her as we had skyped at Christmas but on our day she far surpassed our expectations and really did make us feel special which I\u2019m sure will come through in the pictures. Now I just have to patiently wait for the next month before I get to see the photos.\nThe resort also did a fantastic job. I had reservations just before leaving as they seemed to be nickel and diming me on everything which I thought was just because we were just a small wedding but once I got there the ladies in the wedding department put as at ease and were very accommodating. Before I left I asked them about decorating the gazebo with some fabric and silk flowers I was bringing and they said I would have to pay their vendor (Tia Flora) to do it which made me mad because other brides with more elaborate d\u00e9cor posted on here that the resort did it for them no charge. I didn\u2019t say anything to them via email about this as I figured I would just deal with it once I got there and as it turns out I didn\u2019t need to as they offered to do it for free once they saw what I had. It also probably didn\u2019t hurt that I bribed them with some maple fudge candies I bought at the Toronto airport when we had our wedding meeting with them upon arrival <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\n The reverend was also fantastic. He was funny, kind and made our entire ceremony feel warm and intimate. Even though we had my grandparents, Misha and her assistant, and about 5 resort staff members in the gazebo with us during the ceremony Peter and I felt like we were the only two people there.\nThe weather was perfect too. Sunny, a few clouds and light breeze -except for when I wanted to take pictures with my veil flowing behind me; then the wind died\u2026but hey it that\u2019s the worst that happened I think I can live with that  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  We saw 4 other weddings while we were there and every other one had rain so I guess the man upstairs was looking out for us  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  I really felt bad for one bride. She had her wedding on the beach with about 30 guests and a pretty elaborate set-up for here reception. Looking at the extras she had (strings of lights over the reception areas, upgrades tables, chairs, etc) I would guess she spent about 4K on the reception alone and just as they said \u201cI do\u201d the heavens opened up and they had to move inside for the reception but the resort didn\u2019t have time to move everything so she didn\u2019t get to use it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\n \nI saw your wedding and renewal photos and they are so beautiful! I love both your dresses! You were a stunning bride X 2 \uf04a I can tell from the photos how madly in love you and Doug are with each other.\nI hear ya on just being the two of you. We don\u2019t have children (well two fur-babies but they don\u2019t have any drama) and we love our life the way it is.\n \nFunny you should mentioned being allergic to red wine. I used to be like you. If I had even a couple of sips of red I would get a migraine to the point I would be violently ill then suddenly one day I was fine. At least you still have white wine. Not sure I would be able to exist it I could drink any wine, lol. We absolutely have to get together for wine sometime.\n \nSo funny about you guys going to your trailer every weekend from May 2-4 until Thanksgiving, we are the same with our boat. I guess when you spend that kind of money on something you want to use it as much as possible. We keep our boat in upstate New York on the St. Lawrence River in the heart of the 1000 Islands (our yacht club is right beside Boldt Castle) and there are a few camp grounds\/trailer parks nearby both on the USA and Canada side of the river so if you guys are ever planning to come up that way with the your trailer then we should plan to get together. We can take you out for a cruise of the river and drink wine. Boldt Castle is absolutely beautiful and romantic too. Not sure if you know the story but it was built by George Boldt (he built the Waldorf Astoria in NYC in the early 1900\u2019s). He had an island shaped like a heart (aptly names Heart Island) he was building the castle on as a tribute to the love for his wife but before he could finish building it she died and he was so distraught he left it unfinished. It sat abandoned for many years than the original plans were discovered a few years ago and since then the US Bridge Authority have been working to complete the castle exactly the George\u2019s original dream.\nI\u2019m jealous of your Toronto Brides group that meets up. I wish Ottawa had something like that; especially since I was planning my wedding alone. Would have been nice to have other ladies to bounce ideas off in person. Just further proof that Ottawa is an unfriendly city <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\n The moment I saw my dress online I was in love. It was exactly what I had always dreamed of. I had tried on several other dresses (about 10) before I found a bridal salon in Ottawa that carried Lazaro\u2019s Tata Keely line and as luck would have it they were having a trunk sale the next week so I booked an appointment and asked them to make sure they had that dress there. The sample was too small for me but I still knew it was the one. The woman that was supposed to be my MOH was with me (she was still my MOH back then) and she told me it was an ugly dress and not flattering on me at all so I guess I should have taken that as a sign she was not meant to be my MOH. I just chalked it up as jealousy and knew the dress would be perfect so I ordered it and because it was a trunk sale I saved 10%. Bonus! I was also planning to lose weight and get back to the size I was when Peter and I met 6 years ago so I ordered it 4 sizes too small. The owner of the salon told me not to do it and warned me if the dress did not fit they could not take it out but I knew what I was capable of so I insisted on ordering it in the smaller size. When the dress came in 7 months later not only did it fit they had to take it in 2 \u00bd inches! The owner of the salon was floored. We are taking some more pictures at Peter\u2019s fire station with him in his uniform and the fire trucks so now I just need to make sure to keep my weight in check for the next couple of months so my dress still fits <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/>\n \nI\u2019m working on a few posts and once I get my pictures back from Misha I will be making a review post of her services and my experience with Secrets WO.\n \nThanks for adding me as a friend on Facebook. I\u2019m not the most active person on there but glad we will be able to stay in touch. Even though we have never met face to face I feel so comfortable talking to you and we have so much in common that I consider you a friend. Really hope we get the chance to meet each and our significant others this summer (if not sooner).\n \nWell guess i should get back to actching up on my emails. Been away for almost 2 weeks and have a few hundred emails to weed though <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/rolleyes.gif' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':rolleyes:' \/>\n \nAll the best- Nancy\n \n\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nSo just a couple more sleeps!!! lol I so wish I was going back to Jamaica! We'll get there one of these days.... hopefully sooner than later. But we have to start scouting out our retirement area so Costa Rica, Belize and Panama have to start being on our bucket list very soon!! Doug is already investigating and there's a website we belong to that is just for expats so we get information that helps us. Did you know that you can live very comfortable on about $1500 per month for a couple? Which by the time Doug's ex takes her half of his pension will be about what he gets. lol Seriously though - that's the biggest reason we're going south. We can't afford to retire here. Doug has a super-bitch of an ex-wife. Nuff said.\n \nWow - Lazaro!! Way cool!! You totally have to post pics of your veil!!! I would love to see it. I knit but that's the extent of my creativity lol You're so lucky you can do things like that!\n \nHa ha - you're absolutely right! No red wine here!! I'm violently allergic to red wine so it's a no go. Doug and I did a tour about 2 years ago out near St Catharines and they taught us how to \"taste\" wine (amateur of course but it was fun). They also went through a lot of the wine making process and stuff. But what I found out was that I'm essentially allergic to grape skins!! What an insult that was!! lol I'm ok with white but red lays me out flat in about 15 minutes with a migraine. I eat grapes and that doesn't bother me at all, but he said it's the process that the grapes go through that makes the difference. So.... no red. But I more than make up for it with white!!\n \nI sent you a friend request on FB. Here is the link for the group. I found out I can't add anyone that isn't already on my page, but you can make the request to join if you like instead of accepting the FB request. I'll make sure it gets accepted!  https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1683093905237090\/ (https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1683093905237090\/)\n \nI think if we can make the group trip happen it will be a lot of fun!!  I'm not sure now if we're going to Ottawa this weekend or not. They're forecasting snow and that drive along the 401 is an absolute bitch in a snow storm so Doug says if there is any hint of bad weather we'll postpone but that will make it closer to the end of February. My granddaughter is with her father (my son) next weekend so that's his time, the following weekend is valentine's day and the weekend after that is the long family day weekend so it would be the weekend after that. She'll be disappointed I know but we already warned that it was weather dependent so we'll see what happens. I'm actually out with several of the girls from this site on Friday night. We're the GTA brides meet up group. I missed the one in December because I was sick so I'm looking forward to this one to catch up. We have 2 new brides and one that got married in November but I missed the update with her in December. They're a good group and most have said they're in on the trip. Several want to start a family this year so it's very possible we'll lose a couple that way! I'm so happy we're all done with that. I love it just being Doug and I now. There is very definitely life after children!! lol\n \nI hear ya on Cam Newton. I didn't watch the game because I knew Carolina was going to win so I didn't bother. It was over almost before it got started. But what you said he did doesn't surprise me. Even just to listen to him you know he's an arrogant so and so. But I still can't stoop to rooting for denver. Sorry. lol Besides - I think Carolina will take it anyway. I have the NFL network in my truck and was listening this morning on my way to the train and all it was was manning this, manning that, blah blah blah. I shut it off lol  Isn't it funny sometimes the people that you meet on trips?? We've met football people over the years as well. It makes you realize how small the world can be sometimes!!\n \nI looked up your dress! It's totally gorgeous!!! Wow! I love the layers! It will be beautiful with the veil. I'm a total shoe slut so that's definitely a special treat wearing the Christian Louboutins! I had 2 pairs - one more turquoise, then another pair that were more royal but I loved them both. And wore them both! lol  Hey - did you see the link to our photos and our video?? I meant to ask you. We love the video. It turned out better than I expected! We aren't photogenic either. Well at least I'm not. Doug is. He always looks good in photos. I'm surprise some of our renewal photos are as nice as they are!! lol  Yeah - you'll definitely love Misha Earle. There were several brides that used her the year we got married and the reviews were excellent. I'm looking forward to seeing them!!\n \nAbsolutely we'll get together sometime. We should meet up in wine country in the summer! We try and take off as many weekends as we can with the trailer starting from May 2-4 weekend right through to Thanksgiving, weather permitting so we could always head that way one weekend. We know where a couple of the campgrounds are out that way so easy to get to for sure!!\n \nWell I'm going to head to bed shortly. Have a wonderful trip and a really magical wedding day!! I'll be thinking about you on the 2nd in the beautiful sunshine while we're here in the cold!!! lol\n \nAll the best!\nAnn\n-----------------------------\n\n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=12571&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":284050,"Name":"2ndTimeMrs","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455115663,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":12571},{"Id":138750,"Title":"liked a post you made in General Q - How Much Time B...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMoments That Matter just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI'm going to agree with everyone else and say that having your coordinator meeting the day before, if they'll do it, is no issue. Just make sure you have your questions, notes, emails and set up instructions on hand with your for your meeting. It can last anywhere from and hour to 2 and a half...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79929-general-q-how-much-time-between-wedding-and-coordinating-mtg\/?view=findpost&p=1910678\n","Sender":{"Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455112165,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":138723,"Title":"liked a post you made in Looking For Feedback On My...","Message":"Hello!\n\n2ndTimeMrs just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI think they're gorgeous!!! Love the coral colour! Definitely something you'll be able to keep afterwards!! You did a beautiful job!! Oh and just as an FYI and for any other Canadian brides, you CAN bring back your bouquet. I've done it twice. Customs says it's because they're cut and wrapped...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79893-looking-for-feedback-on-my-flowers\/?view=findpost&p=1910049\n","Sender":{"Id":284050,"Name":"2ndTimeMrs","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455107564,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":138719,"Title":"liked a post you made in Looking For Feedback On My...","Message":"Hello!\n\n2ndTimeMrs just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@2ndTimeMrs  Just wanted to wish you a wonderful wedding day!! I hope it's everything you wanted it to be and more!! Can't wait to see photos!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79893-looking-for-feedback-on-my-flowers\/?view=findpost&p=1910425\n","Sender":{"Id":284050,"Name":"2ndTimeMrs","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455107508,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":138691,"Title":"liked a post you made in Newbie Getting Married Late...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTA Patty just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@MrsGuralewycz2B  I'm absolutely on the travel agent side!! First of all, why would you want the stress? Let a professional handle it. A good agent will work with your budget and the budget you have for your guests as well as helping you stay within that budget. They'll also help with you...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79924-newbie-getting-married-later-this-year\/?view=findpost&p=1910676\n","Sender":{"Id":230028,"Name":"TA Patty","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230028.jpg?_r=1398727965","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455066070,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":138470,"Title":"liked a post you made in How To Pick A Travel Agent\/...","Message":"Hello!\n\nHola2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Congrats on your upcoming wedding! You've had a couple of people give you suggestions with regards to you post and both are great! @  really nailed it as far as what the advantages are to group bookings, especially in canada. I've heard of things being done both ways - a TA that can do not...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79916-how-to-pick-a-travel-agentwedding-planner\/?view=findpost&p=1910543\n","Sender":{"Id":286115,"Name":"Hola2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1454813684,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":138398,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wafflesmom Moon Palace Plan...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHappy wedding day!! Congrats on being a Mrs!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1909950\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1454769552,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":138385,"Title":"liked a post you made in What To Do With My Hair And...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndreamweddings just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I used Styling Trio but yes - with the dollar the way it is they will be expensive unfortunately. I don't know what your spa charges on the resort but it's so worth being pampered on your wedding day! If there is a way to find the funds I highly recommend it!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79883-what-to-do-with-my-hair-and-make-up-help\/?view=findpost&p=1909973\n","Sender":{"Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1454765906,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":138313,"Title":"liked a post you made in Is A Come-And-Go Afternoon...","Message":"Hello!\n\njmp403 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Congrats on your upcoming wedding!\n \nAHR can be tricky things sometimes.You definitely have some challenges associated with yours, namely the fact that you have two cities 6 hours apart. We had an AHR 2 weeks after we got married in Jamaica. It was a small group though - on...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79918-is-a-come-and-go-afternoon-okay-for-ahr\/?view=findpost&p=1910541\n","Sender":{"Id":284005,"Name":"jmp403","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284005.jpg?_r=1447085753","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1454683080,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":138027,"Title":"liked a post you made in Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet U...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@deecol  Wow Dee - that's awesome!! Let me know what the cost will be. I have UK pounds at home!! Thank you!!\n \n@perianjay  I know!! lol  She really looks like she wants to be in the pic!! I thought about chopping the photo to cut them out, and might still. I th...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1910428\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1454418005,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":138019,"Title":"liked a post you made in Zika Virus","Message":"Hello!\n\ndeecol just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@nadiakat17  I totally agree with you! I watched something on the news last night about this exact same thing! Brazil is NOT a country with a great healthcare record to begin with, and with it being such a highly catholic country, birth control is not regularly practised so there is a hig...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79905-zika-virus\/?view=findpost&p=1910427\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1455392044","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":222,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1454417194,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":137952,"Title":"liked a post you made in Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet U...","Message":"Hello!\n\nkrystalball just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOf course! @ashhtayy  ask and you shall receive..... lol  Just ignore the group at the other table!!\n \n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1910394\n","Sender":{"Id":281820,"Name":"krystalball","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281820.jpg?_r=1440261411","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1454393465,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":137941,"Title":"liked a post you made in Toronto (Gta) Brides Meet U...","Message":"Hello!\n\nashhtayy just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOf course! @ashhtayy  ask and you shall receive..... lol  Just ignore the group at the other table!!\n \n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79202-toronto-gta-brides-meet-up\/?view=findpost&p=1910394\n","Sender":{"Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1454372318,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"241","TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":240},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":7,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
