{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79227,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1433100494,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"b1f1d8bf1488bf0d1377bc424959ec9f","RawContent":"RW definitely did have a bridal line from what I can find. But I&#039;m not sure that they still do. I also found J Crew a bit expensive and somewhat limited in selection. Leaning towards David&#039;s at the moment. You really can&#039;t beat them for the options they have available and at reasonable cost. Plus my BMs and I live in 3 different cities so can&#039;t all go to the same store. At least at David&#039;s we are all looking at the same thing. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1897630,"PostDate":1433100345,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                RW definitely did have a bridal line from what I can find. But I'm not sure that they still do. I also found J Crew a bit expensive and somewhat limited in selection. Leaning towards David's at the moment. You really can't beat them for the options they have available and at reasonable cost. Plus my BMs and I live in 3 different cities so can't all go to the same store. At least at David's we are all looking at the same thing. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417431445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79227,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d39c116133bea5b2f005f760b1489c13","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yeah I&#039;m with you on the David&#039;s Bridal dresses. There are 2 dresses in color Oasis which are absolutely perfect for what I&#039;m thinking. Only thing is they are $160 and I really dont want to ask them to spend that kind of money since it is costing them $2000 to come to our wedding :( If worst comes to worst I&#039;ll just subsidize the cost for them and make it more affordable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My other option is a dress on etsy:&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/listing\/230249962\/full-length-convertible-bridesmaid?ref=favs_view_10&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/listing\/230249962\/full-length-convertible-bridesmaid?ref=favs_view_10&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I might just buy it for myself and see if the color is right. If it is then I&#039;ll tell them to buy it, if its not then I just bought myself a cute dress haha. Its kind of a win win situation haha.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897631,"PostDate":1433100723,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">vancouverpetunia<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Yeah I'm with you on the David's Bridal dresses. There are 2 dresses in color Oasis which are absolutely perfect for what I'm thinking. Only thing is they are $160 and I really dont want to ask them to spend that kind of money since it is costing them $2000 to come to our wedding <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> If worst comes to worst I'll just subsidize the cost for them and make it more affordable.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My other option is a dress on etsy:<a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/listing\/230249962\/full-length-convertible-bridesmaid?ref=favs_view_10' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...ef=favs_view_10<\/a><\/p>\n<p>I might just buy it for myself and see if the color is right. If it is then I'll tell them to buy it, if its not then I just bought myself a cute dress haha. Its kind of a win win situation haha.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~*~YYCBRIDE2016~*~<\/p><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/'>My planning thread\u00a0<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;484\/st\/20160223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/4bd8\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"janellepaquin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1432083304,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yycbride2016","Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79227,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b91e354c94fc75e1ed784653dd6b311e","RawContent":"The convertible dresses look awesome.  Let us know if you order it and how it turns out :)\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1897635,"PostDate":1433110273,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The convertible dresses look awesome.  Let us know if you order it and how it turns out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.52.88.235","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79227,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a0cf7bf831f5e53c01db6c25af7aaf97","RawContent":"A couple of ladies here have bought the convertible dresses from etsy and they were super happy with them. They also very reasonably priced. I think they got it from a store called the daintyard on esty\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1897658,"PostDate":1433160282,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                A couple of ladies here have bought the convertible dresses from etsy and they were super happy with them. They also very reasonably priced. I think they got it from a store called the daintyard on esty<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.56.86.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79227,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7dad9b2859b89810d7ba108d94772ef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yes I looked at that store but the teal was more of a jade so I think i&#039;m going to go with a different seller on Etsy. I just went through reading all of the reviews and they were so positive. People had their dresses within 3 weeks and worked great for all sizes. The one I&#039;m looking at is $60+$30 for shipping. But the only catch is the larger size is $80+$30shipping. :( I might subsidize the $20 difference for the&amp;nbsp;girl who needs the larger size to make it fair for everyone.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897666,"PostDate":1433163554,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Yes I looked at that store but the teal was more of a jade so I think i'm going to go with a different seller on Etsy. I just went through reading all of the reviews and they were so positive. People had their dresses within 3 weeks and worked great for all sizes. The one I'm looking at is $60+$30 for shipping. But the only catch is the larger size is $80+$30shipping. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> I might subsidize the $20 difference for the\u00a0girl who needs the larger size to make it fair for everyone.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~*~YYCBRIDE2016~*~<\/p><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/'>My planning thread\u00a0<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;484\/st\/20160223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/4bd8\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"janellepaquin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1432083304,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yycbride2016","Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.64.174.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79227,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"719e1e15deb5236801a0e5080b6036e5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yay a new planning thread!! congrats! I can&#039;t wait to read the rest of your ideas!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897667,"PostDate":1433163628,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yay a new planning thread!! congrats! I can't wait to read the rest of your ideas!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kandkjanzen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.141.108.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406121765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279143.jpg?_r=1411496026","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Smellsey","Id":279143,"Name":"Smellsey","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79227,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc4c2b7aa2c43b360ad0f35c678e2ec5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"yycbride2016\"] I think that&#039;s a good idea. I&#039;d also feel bad for the person who needs a larger size, definitely not fair to them. They&#039;re still a really good price considering most of the bridesmaid dresses out there! :D&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897671,"PostDate":1433165975,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283167\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283167-yycbride2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">yycbride2016<\/span><\/a> I think that's a good idea. I'd also feel bad for the person who needs a larger size, definitely not fair to them. They're still a really good price considering most of the bridesmaid dresses out there! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.158.47.189","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79227,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"49bc2264064d0335f89c63ef21ec27ee","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am getting married at the Grand Sirenis in January! 6 months out now. Looking forward to your planning thread. Feel free to follow mine for updates too!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897704,"PostDate":1433205850,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married at the Grand Sirenis in January! 6 months out now. Looking forward to your planning thread. Feel free to follow mine for updates too!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tmariemurphy@icloud.com","IpAddress":"172.5.209.133","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421489351,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281756.jpg?_r=1454411327","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":137,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"TaraMarie33","Id":281756,"Name":"TaraMarie33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.56.86.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79227,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"e8a5578764f6247699a8b3d1dc9a4b38","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;So I went and picked up my prints for my invitations last night! Ahh! I&#039;m so excited. You guys have no idea how nervous I was. I think there is an added pressure when you design your invitations yourself. I was so nervous I had made a mistake or had typos or printed an old version of them or something. While Kyle was reading over them I was so scared he would find something. Luckily he said they were great! I had them printed at staples and it was fantastic. I droped them off Saturday and picked them up Monday! They even gave me a $20 discount which helped so much! Id recommened looking for coupons when getting invitatoins done. I&#039;ll post a picture of them once I&#039;ve put them together (there&#039;s a lot more work that will go into them: ribbon, starfish charm, glue, etc.)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;HomeSence was terribly placed right next door to Staples.... I made the mistake of going in haha. They have a whole beach theme going on right now. I could easily spend my entire wedding budget there! I found two cute little teal\/turqoise jars that I can put some candles in&amp;nbsp;as table decorations. They also have starfish plates that I might have to go back and buy tonight before they sell out. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I found the almost exact same jar at Bath &amp;amp; Body works this weekend for $25, at HomeSence it was $8&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81276]&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I had previously bought one of these tiny vases at walmart last summer for $1 to put inside a silver vase in my bathroom for a pop of color. So I bought some more this weekend since they are small and the right color. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81278]&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81277]&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I am going to have people instagram our wedding. (I&#039;m addicted to instagram but only post fitness stuff on mine so this is a fun way to incorporate it. I picked a #Hashtag (but i&#039;m not sure if I&#039;m going to use it. I&#039;ll have to keep an eye on it to make sure it doesn&#039;t get used before our wedding). I&#039;m going to print it off and put it in this cute picture frame I got last night:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81279]&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81280]&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I&#039;ve now realized.... I&#039;m dangerous when it comes to finding decorations and everything. Someone is going to have to stop me before I get out of control haha. I&#039;m sure I&#039;ll be bringing a spare suitcase as well as everyone else will be bringing little bits and pieces. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Also... I bought 1 dress from Etsy that will hopefully be my teal convertible bridesmaids dress! It will take 3 weeks to get here so I&#039;m super excited to check it out. They come in 2 sizes: S-M and a Plus size. 2 of my bridesmaids can try on mine and see if it fits and if they like it. The other girl lives out of town and will need the plus size. But at least I&#039;ll be able to get a good idea if I like it or not! So excited!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897723,"PostDate":1433239007,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">So I went and picked up my prints for my invitations last night! Ahh! I'm so excited. You guys have no idea how nervous I was. I think there is an added pressure when you design your invitations yourself. I was so nervous I had made a mistake or had typos or printed an old version of them or something. While Kyle was reading over them I was so scared he would find something. Luckily he said they were great! I had them printed at staples and it was fantastic. I droped them off Saturday and picked them up Monday! They even gave me a $20 discount which helped so much! Id recommened looking for coupons when getting invitatoins done. I'll post a picture of them once I've put them together (there's a lot more work that will go into them: ribbon, starfish charm, glue, etc.)<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">HomeSence was terribly placed right next door to Staples.... I made the mistake of going in haha. They have a whole beach theme going on right now. I could easily spend my entire wedding budget there! I found two cute little teal\/turqoise jars that I can put some candles in\u00a0as table decorations. They also have starfish plates that I might have to go back and buy tonight before they sell out. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I found the almost exact same jar at Bath & Body works this weekend for $25, at HomeSence it was $8<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81276-decorations-1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18038\/sml_gallery_283167_18038_75239.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Decorations 1'  width='150' height='200'  alt='Decorations 1' id='sml_image_view_81276' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I had previously bought one of these tiny vases at walmart last summer for $1 to put inside a silver vase in my bathroom for a pop of color. So I bought some more this weekend since they are small and the right color. <\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81278-decorations-3\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18038\/sml_gallery_283167_18038_58093.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Decorations 3'  width='150' height='200'  alt='Decorations 3' id='sml_image_view_81278' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81277-decorations-2\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18038\/sml_gallery_283167_18038_4665.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Decorations 2'  width='150' height='200'  alt='Decorations 2' id='sml_image_view_81277' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I am going to have people instagram our wedding. (I'm addicted to instagram but only post fitness stuff on mine so this is a fun way to incorporate it. I picked a #Hashtag (but i'm not sure if I'm going to use it. I'll have to keep an eye on it to make sure it doesn't get used before our wedding). I'm going to print it off and put it in this cute picture frame I got last night:<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81279-picture-frame\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18038\/sml_gallery_283167_18038_55487.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Picture frame'  width='150' height='200'  alt='Picture frame' id='sml_image_view_81279' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81280-instagram\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18038\/sml_gallery_283167_18038_873456.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='instagram'  width='200' height='134'  alt='instagram' id='sml_image_view_81280' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I've now realized.... I'm dangerous when it comes to finding decorations and everything. Someone is going to have to stop me before I get out of control haha. I'm sure I'll be bringing a spare suitcase as well as everyone else will be bringing little bits and pieces. <\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Also... I bought 1 dress from Etsy that will hopefully be my teal convertible bridesmaids dress! It will take 3 weeks to get here so I'm super excited to check it out. They come in 2 sizes: S-M and a Plus size. 2 of my bridesmaids can try on mine and see if it fits and if they like it. The other girl lives out of town and will need the plus size. But at least I'll be able to get a good idea if I like it or not! So excited!<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~*~YYCBRIDE2016~*~<\/p><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/'>My planning thread\u00a0<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;484\/st\/20160223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/4bd8\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"janellepaquin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1432083304,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yycbride2016","Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79227,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"ed728ebc139b2e6f2b2b7f70591da564","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Everything is looking great. I was the monster when it came to decorations, and then reading people&#039;s planning threads didn&#039;t help haha, so many fun ideas out there! My suggestion is to keep in mind that you have to bring all this stuff down there. That stopped me many times from buying extra things.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897754,"PostDate":1433252227,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Everything is looking great. I was the monster when it came to decorations, and then reading people's planning threads didn't help haha, so many fun ideas out there! My suggestion is to keep in mind that you have to bring all this stuff down there. That stopped me many times from buying extra things.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":490,"TotalPages":49,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":480},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":7,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
